---
// Modest, factual attribution: who publishes this ecosystem. Kept as its own
// component, used once in index.astro, so it can be dropped by deleting one
// import and one line if the answer on including it changes.
---
<section class="py-12 md:py-16 border-t border-border/60">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Who's behind this</p>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-foreground/85 leading-relaxed">
        democratising.ai is built and published by
        <a href="https://adrianwatkins.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-foreground font-semibold hover:text-accent transition-colors">Adrian Watkins</a>,
        SVP of Commercial Operations and Governance at SQREEM Technologies and creator of the
        EDGE Framework. He also publishes
        <a href="https://www.aiinasia.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-accent transition-colors">AI in Asia</a>
        and built
        <a href="https://promptandgo.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-accent transition-colors">PromptAndGo</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
